From db882a807c28ba3dbb3c66b09a2aeace57dd6c7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Faber <72028327+Jonohas@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:24:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] SystemUI: bound the Duo cover reveal and harden its
 exits

The cover reveal now gives up after the 2000 ms ready timeout and
removes its overlay. Unfolding during a reveal cancels it instead of
resetting the unfold state, the overlay-ready callback runs once even
when attaching fails, and the blur is retried on every update instead of
latching off after one early refusal. The cover clear uses a single
decelerate, and exits release the touch block.
---
